						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;"><FONT CLASS="GrepStyle" STYLE="font-family:'Wingdings 24', sans-serif;">&#9744;</FONT>&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;<FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-variant:small-caps;">abstain</FONT></P>
					</TD>
